// a refusal higher up is still a thing that happened to this request,
// and the group that closes this pass reads its counts off them. record
// is the reading rather than the captured body: the node below takes
// documents.url and documents.body out of it in SQL, where the rule
// that a member which is not a string is not text can sit beside a
// comment saying so.
//
